| 变更 Service | `src/services/photoMutationService.ts` |
| 删除 Hook | `src/hooks/useDelete.ts` |
| 任务执行器 | `src/hooks/core/useTaskExecutor.ts` |
| 反馈 Hook | `src/hooks/uiFeedback.ts` |
